&Q000579

{1 = 1-3}
1.	Traveller, 
2.	traveller, 
3.	say to my mother what @wON{Ugubi} says: 

{4 = 4-11}
4.	@wSN{Urim} is the joyful city of @wDN{Nanna}. 
5.	But I sit behind the door of the chief musician's house in @wSN{Eridug}, 
6.	the abundant city of @wDN{Enki}. 
7.	Longing consumes me. 
8.	I don't want to die because the bread is never fresh 
9.	and the beer is never fresh. 
10.	Send a messenger to me at once. 
11.	It is urgent. 
